[1m[38;5;231mShould the '...' count toward the max length?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mYes, output never exceeds max (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mtruncate: 8 on "hello world" gives "hello..." — exactly 8 characters. The option is a hard cap on output length.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m No, append after the cut
